{"id":51721,"date":"2026-06-19T06:10:10","date_gmt":"2026-06-19T05:10:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/tex-trail-encostas-de-xira\/"},"modified":"2026-09-13T12:32:17","modified_gmt":"2026-09-13T11:32:17","slug":"tex-trail-encostas-de-xira","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/tex-trail-encostas-de-xira\/","title":{"rendered":"TEX \u2013 Trail Encostas de Xira 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">TEX \u2013 Trail Encostas de Xira 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>TEX \u2013 Trail Encostas de Xira 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>13 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, no <strong>Sobralinho<\/strong>, concelho de Vila Franca de Xira. Organizado pela equipa dos <strong>Alverca Urban Runners<\/strong> com apoio da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Vila Franca de Xira e da Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Alhandra, S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o dos Montes e Sobralinho, a prova explora as imponentes cristas montanhosas e os miradouros sobre o estu\u00e1rio do Rio Tejo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e meta instaladas no hist\u00f3rico <strong>Monumento a H\u00e9rcules<\/strong> (junto ao Motoclube de Alhandra), a competi\u00e7\u00e3o integra o <strong>Trail Longo (31 km \/ 1500m D+)<\/strong> e o <strong>Trail Curto (17 km \/ 800m D+)<\/strong> certificados pela ATRP (Grau 2), al\u00e9m do <strong>Mini Trail (10 km \/ 372m D+)<\/strong> e da <strong>Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong>. Todos os participantes usufruem de t-shirt t\u00e9cnica oficial, medalha finisher, cronometragem eletr\u00f3nica com chip Stop and Go, abastecimentos refor\u00e7ados e op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio no final.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">13 de Setembro de 2026 \u00e0s 08:30<\/span><\/li>